---
/*
 * FR-003 framing.
 *
 * There is deliberately NO dismissal mechanism here — no close button, no
 * data attribute, no storage key. Nothing to click means nothing to persist means
 * nothing that can hide it. The requirement is that this cannot be permanently
 * dismissed; the cheapest way to guarantee that is to give it no dismissal path
 * at all. Do not add one.
 */
---

<aside class="framing" aria-label="About this information">
  <p>
    <strong>General information, not advice for your knee.</strong> These movements are described
    as they are commonly taught. Whether any of them suits your knee depends on what is actually
    going on in it — which needs a clinician or physiotherapist, not a website.{' '}
    <a href="/safety/">When to see one</a>.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .framing {
    padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-4);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-warn-border);
    background: var(--c-warn-bg);
    color: var(--c-warn-text);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
  }
  .framing p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--f-size-sm);
  }
  .framing a {
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
